==French==

===Etymology===
14th century, borrowed from {{bor|fr|la|hērōs}}, from {{der|fr|grc|ἥρως}}. The aspiration is secondary and originated in the desire to avoid that {{m|fr||les héros}} sound like {{m|fr||les zéros}}. The related words remain unaspirated.

